    {
        "id": "ab5678c4ad8e7bff",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "subflow1",
        "name": "DB Query with Retry\\n  Executes SQL queries with automatic retry logic and prepared statements support.\\n  Input:\\n - msg.topic: SQL query string (use ? for placeholders)\\n - msg.params: Array of parameters for prepared statements (optional)\\n  Output:\\n - msg.payload: Formatted response (success or error)\\n - msg.statusCode: HTTP status code (200 or 503)\\n  Features:\\n - Up to 3 retry attempts on failure\\n - 1 second delay between retries\\n - Prepared statements support (SQL injection safe)\\n - Consistent JSON response format\\n - Automatic error handling\\n  Example usage:\\n msg.topic = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\";\\n msg.params = [userId];\\n",
        "info": "DB Query with Retry\\n\n\nExecutes SQL queries with automatic retry logic and prepared statements support.\\n\n\nInput:\\n\n- msg.topic: SQL query string (use ? for placeholders)\\n\n- msg.params: Array of parameters for prepared statements (optional)\\n\n\nOutput:\\n\n- msg.payload: Formatted response (success or error)\\n\n- msg.statusCode: HTTP status code (200 or 503)\\n\n\nFeatures:\\n\n- Up to 3 retry attempts on failure\\n\n- 1 second delay between retries\\n\n- Prepared statements support (SQL injection safe)\\n\n- Consistent JSON response format\\n\n- Automatic error handling\\n\n\nExample usage:\\n\nmsg.topic = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\";\\n\nmsg.params = [userId];\\n",
        "x": 350,
        "y": 280,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "cb7d7b5278f27f91",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "subflow1",
        "name": "prepare params",
        "func": "if (msg.params) {\n    msg.payload = msg.params;\n    delete msg.params;\n}\n\nreturn msg;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": 0,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 1060,
        "y": 180,
        "wires": [
            [
                "sf_mysql"
            ]
        ]
    },
