        "name": "Vehicles API endpoints\\n \\n Routes:\\n - {GET} /vehicles\\n     • Without query: returns all vehicles with their associated user\\n     • ?userId=x: returns vehicles filtered by user\\n \\n - {GET} /vehicle\\n     • ?plate=XXX: returns a vehicle filtered by its plate\\n     • Validates parameters and returns 400 if missing or invalid\\n",
        "info": "Vehicles API endpoints\\n\n\\n\nRoutes:\\n\n- {GET} /vehicles\\n\n    • Without query: returns all vehicles with their associated user\\n\n    • ?userId=x: returns vehicles filtered by user\\n\n\\n\n- {GET} /vehicle\\n\n    • ?plate=XXX: returns a vehicle filtered by its plate\\n\n    • Validates parameters and returns 400 if missing or invalid\\n",
